You can use a chapter/part/section of your document as a subject with the following verbs.
Example: Section 2 of this thesis reviews/examines the literature.
Chapter 3 introduces/discusses/describes the methodology.
Chapter 4 presents/summarizes the results of this study.
Chapter 5 concludes.